  "final_answer": "I have all the information I need. Let me provide a comprehensive comparison of the latest MacBook Air models.\n\n## Comparison of Latest MacBook Air Models (M5, 2025)\n\nBased on the data extracted from Apple's website (apple.com.cn), the latest MacBook Air models come in two sizes:\n\n### Starting Prices:\n\n| Model | Chip | Starting Price | Monthly Payment (24 months) |\n|-------|------|----------------|------------------------------|\n| **13-inch MacBook Air (M5)** | 10-core CPU, 8-core GPU | **RMB 9,999** | RMB 417/month |\n| **13-inch MacBook Air (M5)** | 10-core CPU, 10-core GPU | **RMB 10,749** | RMB 448/month |\n| **15-inch MacBook Air (M5)** | 10-core CPU, 10-core GPU | **RMB 11,999** | RMB 500/month |\n\n### Key Observations:\n\n1. **Two Size Options**: The latest MacBook Air lineup is available in 13-inch and 15-inch variants.\n\n2. **Chip Variants**: \n   - The 13-inch model comes in two GPU configurations (8-core GPU standard at RMB 9,999 or 10-core GPU upgrade at RMB 10,749)\n   - The 15-inch model is only available with the 10-core GPU configuration\n\n3. **Price Difference**: The 15-inch model costs **RMB 2,000 more** than the 13-inch model at the starting configuration (both with 10-core GPU).\n\n4. **Configuration Options** that affect the price:\n   - **Memory**: 16GB (standard), 24GB, or 32GB\n   - **Storage**: 512GB (standard) up to 4TB\n   - **Power adapter**: 3 options available\n   - **Keyboard**: 6 language options\n\n5. **Colors**: Available in Starlight (星光色), Sky Blue (天蓝色), Midnight (午夜色), and Silver (银色) — same prices across all color options for each configuration.\n\nThe above are the base prices; higher memory and storage configurations would increase the final price.",
